  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "A_txt",
   "x": 258,
   "y": 262,
   "width": 350,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "1 listener stanza: find its TLS-disabled setting\n2 server cert from internal CA, SANs = service +\n  every replica's peer name\n3 listener -> mounted cert, key and CA\n4 cluster-join addresses -> HTTPS + CA file\n5 probes -> HTTPS (the probe skips verification)\n6 operator + injected agents trust the new CA\n7 whole change behind a boolean: off = rollback",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100
  },
